    narr:narration """The narrative surrounding [core feature decision capture](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has evolved from a foundational product thesis established in March 2026 into a concrete operational milestone by August 2026. The initial framing positioned the [capture of decision artifacts](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) as the primary product differentiator. By late August, this conceptual goal was grounded in specific team performance metrics and technical milestones, notably the [shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787390952719_1) and the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787390952719_3). The discourse now centers on [quantifying sprint success](narr:Position_Sprint4QuantifiedSuccessEvidence) through a combination of velocity data and feature-based unlocks, bridging the gap between high-level product strategy and tangible delivery evidence.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787390952719_1> ;
